        <description><![CDATA[<div>
<p>Use this form to book a service with the health and wellness team or a confidential appointment with a nurse counsellor.  </p>
</div>
<div>
<p>The team offers coaching, guidance and referrals to help you access the right resources. Services include mental and physical health support, general health consultations, access to training, on-site crisis support and help to minimize psychological risk factors.  </p>
</div>
<div>
<p>A description of the services is available by selecting the <strong>“?” icon next to the Type of request field</strong>. </p>
</div>
<div>
<p>All nursing support requests are confidential and will not be shared with your manager without your consent. Please note that nurse counsellors do not provide prescriptions or medical notes. </p>
</div>
<div>
<p>You can expect a reply within <strong>24 business hours</strong>. </p>
</div>
<div>
<p><strong>Note</strong>: In case of a medical emergency, please call the Parliamentary Protective Service emergency line at           613-992-7000. Security personnel are available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. They are responsible for dealing with emergencies and certified in first aid and CPR. </p>
</div>]]></description>
